            </div>
            
            <div class="prize-card runner-up">
                <div class="prize-badge">2nd Place</div>
                <div class="prize-amount">Rp 1.000.000</div>
                <div class="prize-title">Pilot with CICON</div>
                <p>Test and run your idea with support from the CICON team. A chance to see it in action and make real impact.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>